Package: PDPMVAR
Title: Bayesian Product Mixture Models for Vector Autoregressions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joshua", "Lukemire", email = "joshua.lukemire@emory.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Suprateek", "Kundu", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Fits Bayesian vector autoregressive models for multiple subjects
    using products of Dirichlet process mixtures. Subjects can share
    autoregressive coefficients through a single partition across all lags,
    separate partitions by lag, or separate partitions by response node.
    Residual covariance matrices have a separate subject partition. Provides
    Markov chain Monte Carlo sampling and diagnostics for comparing fits
    across chains. The models are described in Kundu and Lukemire (2024)
    <https://jmlr.org/papers/v25/22-0717.html>.
